/-!
# A101440

Replace each digit of n with 1 followed by n 0's: 0 -> 1, 1 -> 10, 2 -> 100, ..., 9 -> 1000000000, 10 -> 101, 11 -> 1010, 12 -> 10100, etc. Expanded number is then converted from binary to decimal: 0 -> 1 -> 1, 1 -> 10 -> 2, 2 -> 100 -> 4, 9 -> 1000000000 -> 512, 10 -> 101 -> 5, etc.

The 55 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `0`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A101440

